{"id":"schastlivo","lemma":"счастливо","pos":"intj","rank":1514,"glosses":["An informal farewell."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Ru-%D1%81%D1%87%D0%B0%CC%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%87%D0%B0%CC%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он был счастливо женат.","en":"He was happily married.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"А потом они жили долго и счастливо.","en":"They lived happily ever afterward.","words":[{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"afterwards"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"a long time"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Она счастливо улыбнулась.","en":"She smiled happily.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},null,null]},{"text":"Я надеюсь, что они будут жить долго и счастливо.","en":"I hope they live happily ever after.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"надеяться"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"a long time"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Том был счастливо женат.","en":"Tom was happily married.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]}]}